sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Bus
  participant Q as Quests
  participant P as Progression
  participant I as Items
  participant W as Website reads
  B->>Q: followKudosGiven (thoughtful kudos)
  Q->>Q: questsFor(member).path === monday
  Q->>Q: advance onboarding step or drawn slot
  Q->>P: recordReward(rewardKey, {xp, coins: 0}) idempotent
  Q->>I: earnItem(hoggie, quest:rewardKey, reason quest) idempotent
  Q->>B: publish questFinished
  Note over Q: onboarding finished → next draw on the next sweep or read
  W->>Q: questsFor + journey + week slots
  W->>I: isWaiting / isTurned(quest:rewardKey)
